"Krvavá lóža": "Bloody Lodge",
"Nič nevidíš, nič nekupuješ.": "See nothing, buy nothing.",
"Čierna nikdy nevyjde z módy.": "Black never goes out of style.",
"Zlato hovorí za teba.": "Gold speaks for you.",
