"Zlodej": "Thief",
"Stred. Polovici úderov Svalovca sa vyhne. Úder mu dvíha Obratnosť.": "Balanced. Dodges half of the Brute's hits. His hits scale with Agility.",
"Dealer": "Dealer",
"Najsilnejší úder, ktorý ignoruje brnenie, ale najmenej životov. Úder mu dvíha Charizma.": "The strongest hit, which ignores armor, but the fewest HP. His hits scale with Charisma.",
