"Ripper ukradol Wexlerovi tehličku! Zasiahni ho, kým neujde.": "Ripper stole a gold bar from Wexler! Hit him before he gets away.",
"Gang: {text}": "Gang: {text}",
"Hľadanosť {n} z 5: polícia na ulici": "Wanted {n} of 5: police on the street",
"hlavný": "main",
"bonus": "bonus",
"Každý víkend od piatku {hod}:00 do nedele polnoci bežia dva eventy naraz: jeden hlavný a jeden bonus. Poradie sa opakuje každých {n} týždňov.": "Every weekend from Friday {hod}:00 to midnight Sunday, two events run at once: one main and one bonus. The order repeats every {n} weeks.",
