"Na konci ťa čaká": "At the end, you face",
"Horúca misia: súper je zhruba rovnako silný ako ty, takže môžeš prehrať. Za výhru {n}× peniaze aj XP. Šanca na výhru: asi {sanca} %.": "Hot mission: the opponent is about as strong as you, so you can lose. Winning pays {n}× money and XP. Chance to win: about {sanca} %.",
"Si zatknutý, misie až o {cas}.": "You're arrested, missions in {cas}.",
"Na túto misiu máš dnes priveľký heat. Vyber kratšiu, zájdi za právničkou (dnes ešte {n}×) alebo počkaj do polnoci ({cas}).": "You have too much heat for this mission today. Pick a shorter one, visit the lawyer ({n}× left today) or wait until midnight ({cas}).",
"Prijať horúcu misiu": "Accept hot mission",
"Prijať misiu": "Accept mission",
"Heat je tvoj denný limit na misie. Dvíha sa už pri prijatí misie a o polnoci spadne na nulu.": "Heat is your daily mission limit. It rises as soon as you accept a mission and drops to zero at midnight.",
"Rýchly štart do úrovne {n}: misie trvajú len chvíľu a dávajú viac XP.": "Quick start to level {n}: missions take only a moment and give more XP.",
