"len dnes večer": "tonight only",
"Čierny trh je vypredaný.": "The Black Market is sold out.",
"Všetko vypredané.": "Everything sold out.",
"Čierny trh: v piatok od {h}:00, len epické kusy. Každý stojí peniaze a {n} zlatých tehličiek.": "Black Market: Fridays from {h}:00, epic pieces only. Each costs money and {n} gold bars.",
"Odomyká sa na úrovni {n}.": "Unlocks at level {n}.",
"Nový tovar hneď · {n} zlatá tehlička": "New stock now · {n} gold bar",
"Nový tovar hneď · zadarmo": "New stock now · free",
"Nový tovar o <span data-until=\"{until}\"></span> alebo po novej úrovni.": "New stock in <span data-until=\"{until}\"></span> or after a new level.",
"Auto znižuje heat z misií aj ich čas. Nasadiť ho môžeš od úrovne {n}.": "The car lowers heat from missions and their time. You can equip it from level {n}.",
"Mechanik vylepší tvoje nasadené veci. Každé vylepšenie pridá 10 % bonusu, najviac +{n}. Garáž drží tvoj gang.": "The mechanic upgrades your equipped items. Each upgrade adds 10 % bonus, up to +{n}. Your gang holds the garage.",
"maximum": "maximum",
"Nemáš nasadené žiadne predmety.": "You have no items equipped.",
"„Polícia ťa má v hľadáčiku? Za správnu cenu sa papiere stratia.“": "“Police have you in their sights? For the right price, the paperwork gets lost.”",
"Heat je tvoj denný limit na misie a sám od seba neklesá. O polnoci spadne na nulu (o <span data-until=\"{until}\"></span>). Od {n} % hrozí po misii razia.": "Heat is your daily mission limit and it doesn't drop on its own. It falls to zero at midnight (in <span data-until=\"{until}\"></span>). From {n} % a raid can follow a mission.",
"Znížiť heat o {n} % · {cena}": "Lower heat by {n} % · {cena}",
"Amnestia: za polovicu a bez denného limitu.": "Amnesty: half price, no daily limit.",
"Dnes ešte {n} z {total}.": "{n} of {total} left today.",
"Dnes už nie. Ďalšie {total} o polnoci.": "None left today. {total} more at midnight.",
"Všetci bossovia {place} sú porazení.": "All bosses of {place} are defeated.",
"Zo stanice sa dá odísť do Mesta 2, ak máš úroveň {n}.": "You can leave the station for City 2 if you're level {n}.",
"Ďalšie mesto príde neskôr.": "The next city comes later.",
