"Životy {hp}<br>Úder {dmg}": "HP {hp}<br>Hit {dmg}",
"Šanca na výhru: takmer žiadna": "Chance to win: almost none",
"Šanca na výhru: takmer istá": "Chance to win: almost certain",
"Šanca na výhru: asi {n} %": "Chance to win: about {n} %",
"Najprv zosilnej: misie, body v Posilňovni a lepšia výbava v obchodoch.": "Get stronger first: missions, points in the Gym and better gear from the shops.",
"Odmena: <span class=\"gold\">{cash} · {xp} XP{bars}</span> · predmet: {drop}": "Reward: <span class=\"gold\">{cash} · {xp} XP{bars}</span> · item: {drop}",
"<span style=\"color:#ff6aa8\">istý epický</span> (prvý boss)": "<span style=\"color:#ff6aa8\">guaranteed epic</span> (first boss)",
"{epic} % epický, {legend} % legendárny": "{epic} % epic, {legend} % legendary",
"Bojovať · Hon na bossov, bez čakania": "Fight · Boss hunt, no waiting",
"Bojovať · pokus zadarmo": "Fight · free attempt",
"Bojovať za {n} zlatých tehličiek": "Fight for {n} gold bars",
"Platené pokusy dnes: {left} / {max}.": "Paid attempts today: {left} / {max}.",
"Platené pokusy sú na dnes minuté.": "Paid attempts for today are used up.",
"Ďalší pokus zadarmo o <span data-until=\"{until}\"></span>": "Next free attempt in <span data-until=\"{until}\"></span>",
"Línia bossov {place}": "Boss line {place}",
"Do tímu si môžeš zobrať 1–2 členov gangu (príde s gangmi).": "You can bring 1–2 gang members on your team (they come with the gangs).",
"Taxík alebo električka ťa odvezie do iného mesta. Kým ťa naháňa polícia alebo sedíš v skrýši, nikam sa nejde.": "A taxi or tram takes you to another city. You can't go anywhere while the police are after you or you're hiding out.",
"Tu si": "You are here",
"Zamknuté": "Locked",
"Pivnica pod klubom, kde sa bije o peniaze a meno. Sto súperov, každý silnejší ako ten pred ním.": "The cellar under the club, where you fight for money and a name. A hundred opponents, each stronger than the last.",
"Porazil si všetkých {total} súperov. V pivnici pod klubom už nie je nikto, kto by sa ti postavil.": "You beat all {total} opponents. Nobody left in the cellar under the club will stand against you.",
"Poschodie {n} / {total}": "Floor {n} / {total}",
"legendárny predmet": "legendary item",
"epický predmet": "epic item",
"Odmena za výhru: <span class=\"gold\">{cash} · {xp} XP{extra}</span>": "Win reward: <span class=\"gold\">{cash} · {xp} XP{extra}</span>",
"Nastúpiť do ringu": "Enter the ring",
"Ďalší zápas o <span data-until=\"{until}\"></span>": "Next fight in <span data-until=\"{until}\"></span>",
"epický predmet a {n} tehl.": "epic item and {n} bars",
"Poschodia s odmenou navyše": "Floors with a bonus reward",
"Jeden zápas za {n} minút, vyhraný aj prehraný. Prehra ťa nevráti späť. Poradie nájdeš v Sieni slávy.": "One fight every {n} minutes, win or lose. Losing doesn't push you back. You'll find the ranking in the Hall of Fame.",
"Polícia má dve oddelené strany: <b class=\"gold\">heat</b> sleduje len tvoje misie počas dňa, <b class=\"gold\">hviezdy</b> sú naháňačka na ulici za všetko ostatné. Jedno druhé neovplyvňuje.": "The police have two separate sides: <b class=\"gold\">heat</b> tracks only your missions during the day, <b class=\"gold\">stars</b> are the street chase for everything else. Neither affects the other.",
"Heat": "Heat",
"Denný limit na misie. Zdvihne ho iba misia, nič na ulici. Keď je plný, misie od Dona a Dílera na dnes končia. O polnoci spadne na nulu. Auto ho znižuje.": "The daily mission limit. Only a mission raises it, nothing on the street does. When it's full, Don and Díler's missions stop for today. It drops to zero at midnight. A car lowers it.",
"Razia": "Raid",
"Od {n} % heatu ťa po misii môže čakať razia: pokuta {fine} peňazí alebo {min} minút v base.": "From {n} % heat, a raid may follow a mission: a fine of {fine} money or {min} minutes in jail.",
"Zníži heat o {n} %, najviac {max}-krát za deň. Platí sa peniazmi.": "Lowers heat by {n} %, up to {max} times a day. Paid in money.",
"Hviezdy": "Stars",
"Hľadanosť na ulici. Pribúdajú za všetko mimo misií: streľbu, bitku, autá, výbuchy, policajtov, graffiti, útok gangu aj útek z kontroly. Od {n} hviezd ťa naháňajú policajti. Keď ťa nevidia, každých {sec} s stratíš hviezdu.": "Wanted level on the street. It rises for everything outside missions: shooting, brawls, cars, explosions, cops, graffiti, gang attacks and running from a check. From {n} stars the cops chase you. When they can't see you, you lose a star every {sec} s.",
"Keď ťa policajt chytí, vyberieš si: utiecť (šanca podľa Obratnosti), podplatiť (Charizma zlacňuje) alebo sa vzdať ({min} minút bez misií). Potom máš {peace} minút pokoj.": "When a cop catches you, you choose: run (chance from Agility), bribe (Charisma makes it cheaper) or give up ({min} minutes without missions). Then you get {peace} minutes of peace.",
"Zložený policajt": "Downed cop",
"Každý zložený policajt zdvojnásobí, koľko ich po tebe ide. Môže z neho padnúť epický predmet ({chance}, najviac {max} za deň). Ak ťa potom chytia, prídeš o {share} peňazí alebo máš {hours} bez misií.": "Each downed cop doubles how many come after you. An epic item may drop from one ({chance}, up to {max} a day). If they catch you afterwards, you lose {share} of your money or get {hours} without missions.",
"Basa": "Jail",
"Kým si v base, nedostaneš misie od Dona a Dílera. Denné misie na mape robiť môžeš.": "While you're in jail, you don't get missions from Don and Díler. You can still do the daily map tasks.",
"Skrýša a tieň": "Hideout and shadow",
"Keď ťa hľadajú, schovaj sa v skrýši na {min} minút. Hviezdy zmiznú a ďalších {shadow} minút si v tieni: polícia ťa nenaháňa.": "When they're looking for you, hide out for {min} minutes. The stars disappear and you stay in the shadows for another {shadow} minutes: the police won't chase you.",
"Ako funguje polícia": "How the police work",
"Od úrovne {n}": "From level {n}",
"Teraz máš úroveň {n}. Úrovne získaš za misie, denné misie a bossov.": "You're level {n} now. You gain levels from missions, daily missions and bosses.",
"V aréne sa biješ s inými hráčmi o body v rebríčku. Najprv sa trochu otrkaj na misiách.": "In the Arena you fight other players for points on the ranking. Get some experience on missions first.",
"Súboje prebehnú automaticky podľa statov a výbavy.": "Fights run automatically based on stats and gear.",
"Zadarmo ešte <span class=\"gold\">{left} z {max}</span>, obnova o <span data-until=\"{until}\"></span>.": "Free fights left: <span class=\"gold\">{left} of {max}</span>, refill in <span data-until=\"{until}\"></span>.",
"Zadarmo ešte <span class=\"gold\">{left} z {max}</span>.": "Free fights left: <span class=\"gold\">{left} of {max}</span>.",
"Súperi s hviezdičkou sú skutoční hráči.": "Opponents with a star are real players.",
"Súperi sú zatiaľ počítačoví.": "Opponents are computer-controlled for now.",
